<h2 class="vetrina-section-title">Quick Start</h2>

<div class="vetrina-grid">
  <div class="vetrina-grid-terminal">
    <div class="terminal-window">
      <div class="terminal-header">
        <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
        <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
        <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
        <span class="terminal-title">bash</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body">
        <div class="terminal-comment"># Basic usage — tab-separated columns</div>
        <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> fakedata email country</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">cemshid@example.com Afghanistan</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">LucasPerdidao@example.me Turkey</div>

        <div class="terminal-comment"># Deterministic output with a seed</div>
        <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> fakedata --seed 42 email country</div>

        <div class="terminal-comment"># CSV with header row</div>
        <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> fakedata -H -s "," email country</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">email,country</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">keryilmaz@test.name,Vietnam</div>

        <div class="terminal-comment"># NDJSON output</div>
        <div class="terminal-line">
          <span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> fakedata --format ndjson -n 3 email country
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">{"email":"plbabin@test.org","country":"Lithuania"}</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">{"email":"bermonpainter@test.us","country":"Haiti"}</div>

        <div class="terminal-comment"># Stream rows indefinitely</div>
        <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> fakedata --stream email</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">syropian@test.cg</div>
        <div class="terminal-line terminal-output">findingjenny@example.pohl</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="vetrina-grid-content">
    <p class="vetrina-intro-text">
      FakeData generates realistic test data right in your terminal: no config files, no setup. Just name the columns
      you need. It ships with
      <strong>80+ generators</strong>.
    </p>

    <p class="vetrina-intro-text">
      Use <strong>templates</strong> for custom output, enable <strong>shell completion</strong> for bash/zsh/fish, or
      pin results with <strong>deterministic seeding</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

